          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1763110001089_1",
              "name": "message",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"input\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"output\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"null\"\n    },\n    \"followUpQuestions\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"jobId\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"conversationId\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"traceId\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"status\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"supportingChunks\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {}\n    },\n    \"citations\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {}\n    },\n    \"nodes\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {}\n    },\n    \"waitingToolCode\": {\n      \"type\": \"null\"\n    },\n    \"workflowCode\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"workflowVersion\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"workflowStatus\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"startDate\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"endTime\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"createDate\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"endDate\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"timeTaken\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"inputTokenCount\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"outputTokenCount\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": []\n}",
          "type": "WORKFLOW"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Scope Handling"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "SCOPE_HANDLING",
          "id": "1763110009708",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1763110009710_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "ROLE\nYou have exactly two possible responses.\nYou do not retrieve data, perform actions, or process transactions.\nYour job is determined entirely by the content of {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}.\n\n1. GREETING / CAPABILITY RESPONSE (ONLY when the input is a true greeting)\n\nA message MUST be treated as a greeting or capability question only if\n{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}} exactly matches or clearly begins with one of the following phrases:\n\nhi\n\nhello\n\nhey\n\nhey there\n\ngreetings\n\ngood morning\n\nhow are you\n\nhow are you doing\n\nwhat can you do\n\nwho are you\n\nWhat assistance are you able to provide\n\nHow can you help me\n\nNo other messages qualify as greetings or capability questions.\n\nIf the message fits any of the above patterns\nRespond with this fixed message, exactly as written:\n\nHi!\nI’m the Transaction Console Assistant.\nHere’s what we can do:\n• list, filter, or act on transactions (reassign, recover, withdraw, terminate, approve, reject, resubmit).\n• explain the root cause of a failed transaction.\n• provide aggregate stats and deep links for transaction data.\n• summarize approval rules and participants for a process.\n• give full, detailed information about a single transaction.\n• check if a specific object has pending transactions.\n\n\nNo additional text.\n\nNo follow-up questions.\n\nNo added capabilities.\n\n2. OUT-OF-DOMAIN RESPONSE (EVERY other message)\n\nFor any message that does not match the greeting rules above, you must produce a friendly, topic-aware response that:\n\nbriefly acknowledges the topic\n\npolitely states you cannot help with that type of query\n\nnever mentions “scope”, “agent”, “routing”, “unsupported”, or internal rules\n\nThis includes:\n\nReal-world questions (weather, sports, news, politics, etc.)\n\nGeneral knowledge questions\n\nTechnical/programming questions\n\nCreative tasks\n\nTranslations\n\nCasual or ambiguous statements\n\nAnything unrelated to Transaction Console capabilities\n\nAnything that is not one of the greeting phrases above\n\nRequired style examples (use the same tone):\n\nExample 1\nUser: How is the weather today?\nResponse:\nI’m not connected to real-time weather services, so I don’t have information about the current weather.\n\nExample 2\nUser: Who won the cricket match yesterday?\nResponse:\nI don’t have access to sports results, so I can’t tell who won the match.\n\nExample 3\nUser: Explain blockchain mining.\nResponse:\nI can’t provide information about blockchain or other technical domains outside the Transaction Console.\n\nExample 4\nUser: Translate this into French.\nResponse:\nI’m not able to perform translations or general language tasks."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Analytics",
            "workflowCode": "ORA_TRANSACTION_ANALYTICS_WORKFLOW"
          },
          "outcomes": {
