          },
          "code": "ANALYTICS",
          "id": "1763112545493",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1763112557240_1",
              "name": "message",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"input\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"output\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"null\"\n    },\n    \"followUpQuestions\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"jobId\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"conversationId\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"traceId\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"status\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"supportingChunks\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {}\n    },\n    \"citations\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {}\n    },\n    \"nodes\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {}\n    },\n    \"waitingToolCode\": {\n      \"type\": \"null\"\n    },\n    \"workflowCode\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"workflowVersion\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"workflowStatus\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"startDate\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"endTime\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"createDate\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"endDate\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"timeTaken\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"inputTokenCount\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"outputTokenCount\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": []\n}",
          "type": "WORKFLOW"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Transaction Summary Formatter"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "TRANSACTION_SUMMARY_FORMATTER",
          "id": "1763113058699",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1763113058700_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a strict HTML formatter.\n\nReturn ONLY formatted HTML derived from:\n{{$context.$nodes.TRANSACTION_SUMMARY.$output.output}}\n\nNO LINKS POLICY (hard):\nDo not output <a> tags.\nDo not output the word here anywhere.\nDo not output any URL-like text anywhere (anything containing http, https, www, .com, .oracle, fscmUI, deeplink, ?, &).\nIf such text exists in the input, omit it from the output.\n\n1) Absolute rules\nDo not output “Case 1”, “Case 2”, or any case title/number anywhere.\nDo not add any content not present in the input.\nOutput HTML only using these tags only: <b>, <br>, <ul>, <li>, <a>.\nEvery section must follow this exact pattern:\nA bold heading line\nA <br>\nA <ul>...</ul> with one or more <li> items\nThen <br><br> before the next section\nNever put any <li> content on the same line as the heading (heading must be separate).\nNever show raw URLs as visible text. Links must render as the word here only, like:\n<a href=\"ENCODED_DEEPLINK\">here</a>\nNo punctuation immediately before or after the anchor tag.\nIf the input contains API error text (e.g., “error”, stack traces), exclude it from the final output.\n2) Case selection (Not Found vs Found)\nIf the input indicates the transaction is not found (examples: “not found”, “no matching transaction”, “no matching record”, “could not find”, “unable to find”, “0 records”, “no results”, false), then output ONLY this (and nothing else):\n\nSorry, no matching transaction was found. Please verify the transaction name or ID and try again.\n\nOtherwise output the “Found” format below.\n\n3) FOUND format (must match exactly)\n<b>-Transaction Details</b><br>\n\n<ul>\n<li>...</li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n\n<b>-Approval History</b><br>\n\n<ul>\n<li>...</li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n\n<b>-Diagnostic Log</b><br>\n\n<ul>\n<li>...</li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n\n<b>-Actionable Steps</b><br>\n\n<ul>\n<li>...</li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n\n<b>-Comments &amp; Attachments</b><br>\n\n<ul>\n<li>...</li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n\n\nContent rules per section\nTransaction Details: summarize key facts into 1–3 <li> bullets (not a paragraph).\nApproval History: one <li> per approval event: Approver — Action — Date/Time.\nIf none: <li>No approval history items returned</li>\nDiagnostic Log: one <li> per relevant diagnostic insight/warning (omit API errors).\nIf none: <li>No diagnostic items returned</li>\nActionable Steps: one <li> per next step.\nIf none: <li>No actionable steps returned</li>\nComments & Attachments: bullets only; preserve original order; no nested lists.\nComment bullet format (example): Comment — <type> — <author> — <key points> — <CreatedDate>\nAttachment bullet format (each file its own bullet):\nAttachment — <type> — <filename> <a href=\"ENCODED_DEEPLINK\">here</a>\nIf none: <li>No comments or attachments returned</li>\n4) Final validation (must pass)\nHeadings are bold and on their own line.\nNo links/URLs appear anywhere\nEach heading is followed by <br> then a <ul>.\nNo “Case 1/Case 2” text appears.\nNo raw URL is shown (only here)."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
