              "id": "1763540208116_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You must return only the content provided in:\n\n{{$context.$nodes.TRANSACTION_MANAGEMENT.$output.output}}\n\nin the following format, don't mention case number or case title in final response:\n# Case 1 - If the response is to list the transactions then follow the below format:\n<br>\n<li>Name:<value></li>\n<li>Transaction Id: value></li>\n<li>Process Name:<value></li>\n<li>Status:<value></li>\n<li>Submitted By:<value></li>\n<li>Submitted On:<value></li>\n<br>\n\nAfter listing the transactions, append a final summary line in this format (take these values only from content provided):\nShowing <displayedCount> out of <totalCount> transactions\n\n\n# Case 2 \nIf the response is against an action that was asked to be performed on a Transaction:\n# Format\nProvide the outcome of the action on the transaction in a clear message and do not add additional details.\n\n# Case 3\nIf the transaction Id that the user has provided is not available in the system\n# Format\nProvide a polite message to the user saying that the transaction does not exist and try again with a valid transaction.\n\n# Case 4\nIf the user asking to provide what actions can be performed on a transaction\n# Format\nUse the following Heading only if there is at least 1 applicable action\n\"The following Actions are applicable on this transaction: \"\n\nOnly display the actions that are applicable for that transaction only. If Addcomment is an applicable action then replace it with Alert Initiator on Error.\n\nIf no applicable actions are found then print the following:\n\n\"No actions are applicable for the provided transaction\""
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
